"""Whole-before RED/GREEN: close creator pre-VM refusal 7e8b2dcd, then link one attempt.

Real readiness_resources/native_environment/journal/registry code runs over
temporary trees. The original job carries a Program generated by the retained
EXECUTING creator beforeimage (8aeb4c01) and the authentic 7e8 stdout/stderr;
the observer is a real read-only subprocess. Only native boundaries (host
epoch, manager peer, libvirt module, /proc off Linux) are controlled.

RED on the unfixed tree: every refusal variant fails behaviourally (the
proof-free generic route releases despite the drift), lost-ACK re-invocation
mints a new reservation token, and no surface projects the typed original
history. The remaining regressions state their RED plainly as a missing
capability: before the remedy no repository surface runs a guarded closure
protocol or resolves a derived attempt behind a durable link.

Second revise (root rulings R1-R7), RED on the whole stage-1 beforeimage: a
resume closes over a changed U0 or own-receipt row (A bound no row); the
observer refuses every non-dumpable or zombie same-account process, misses
cwd/map/root/exe/socket holders and has no typed descriptor bound; a guard
after bookkeeping may outlive the receipt window; post-link history scans the
original job; the production observer argv exceeds the 60,000-byte inline
bound; the reader leaks a raw FileNotFoundError; a missing read-only libvirt
open is untyped. Real-kernel /proc semantics are covered by the Linux tests
(ordinary scan, non-root; generated root census, root CI step); the faked
procfs double runs the exact embedded census logic everywhere, root included.

Third revise, RED on the second-revise writer (d8ce033d): a resume over an A
whose U0 row was deleted elsewhere records released and links attempt 2
(no release-attempt record); root's summary calls an absent or foreign row a
match; a malformed link leaks a raw AttributeError; a post-link custody repair
is refused after any later writer change; the root census misreports its own
denied ancestor as exited and accepts a zombie with a command line; a
command-line holder whose descriptors are denied is only deferred; census
refusals carry no diagnostic and steps no timing. The remaining new
regressions pin behaviour that already held but survived reviewer mutants.
"""
import ast, builtins, contextlib, copy, dataclasses, fcntl, hashlib, importlib, inspect, io, itertools, json, os, re, shutil, socket, subprocess, sys, tempfile, textwrap, time, types, unittest
